## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

CURRENT uses owned Tonkarome as the executable dry coumarinic body and requires no raw-stock dose below 10 µL. The optional pure-Coumarin role control requires a verified 10% w/w stock prepared from owned neat powder: dissolve 1.000 g Coumarin into 9.000 g TEC, label by mass, and dose that stock only at 10 µL or more in a carrier-matched constant-total arm. Hay Absolute remains omitted pending stock-basis and composite-natural authority. Verify EB before any physical trial; this preparation does not authorize compounding or release.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LN-07 and LN-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Only after preparation verification, add a carrier-matched pure-Coumarin role control. Judge dry hay-skin character, cardamom-lavender retention, dessert/powder drift, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

